%% alt: Transshipment cargo flow — a feeder ship enters port and discharges containers, which wait in a bonded area without crossing the customs line, then are loaded onto a mainline vessel and depart. Since the customs line is never crossed, this counts only as port throughput, not import statistics
flowchart LR
  A["Feeder ship arrives"] --> B["Discharge"]
  B --> C["Wait in bonded area<br/>No inspection"]
  C --> D["Load on mainline vessel"]
  D --> E["Depart"]
  B -.->|"No customs line crossing"| X["Port fee only<br/>No import stats · Throughput counted"]
